{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":28622,\"title\":\"Young, Dumb And Living Off Mum\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Young, Dumb and Living Off Mum was an entertainment/reality series airing on BBC Three. The series followed a group of young adults who have been waited on hand and foot their whole lives. The series sees them living together in a house and fending for themselves. Each week they must compete against each other in tough work challenges set by their parents, designed to encourage them to become more independent. After each assignment, their parents meet to watch the footage of the task and decide who, based on behaviour and performance, should be eliminated from the competition. At the end of the series, the winner receives a round-the-world trip for two people. The show is part of BBC Three's Adult Season. All episodes are narrated by Robert Webb and produced by Byron Archard.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/57nujrcHU0T0zfk2epLF5XxJBUh.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3HJUFbJf7N83UpSzUMlNRrFsL5p.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2009,\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Documentary\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":3,\"totalEpisodes\":18,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"BBC Three\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2011-09-18\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":62960,\"name\":\"Robert Webb\",\"character\":\"Narrator (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5JORWTd5gT1tQmPsRC36mDeiOOd.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"SKRgt5_0Byc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"uqFoWInzvkg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"dchNnTdG2dk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\